    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the forgotten ruins of <strong>Frilensgrade</strong>, a kingdom now engulfed in shadows and mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by fate, two players must navigate in this kingdom to solve ancient mechanisms and face a cursed legacy - together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Asymmetrical puzzle-solving</strong>: each player sees the world differently. Communication is your only lifeline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Challenging cooperative gameplay:</strong> explore, decode, and survive through twisted logic and eerie environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Atmospheric dark fantasy:</strong> a minimalistic low-poly art style enhances a world of dread, wonder, and forgotten lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Designed for 2-player online co-op via Steam</strong>. Trust is everything \u2014 betrayal is losing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you make it... or not?</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the forgotten ruins of <strong>Frilensgrade</strong>, a kingdom now engulfed in shadows and mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by fate, two players must navigate in this kingdom to solve ancient mechanisms and face a cursed legacy - together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Asymmetrical puzzle-solving</strong>: each player sees the world differently. Communication is your only lifeline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Challenging cooperative gameplay:</strong> explore, decode, and survive through twisted logic and eerie environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Atmospheric dark fantasy:</strong> a minimalistic low-poly art style enhances a world of dread, wonder, and forgotten lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Designed for 2-player online co-op via Steam</strong>. Trust is everything \u2014 betrayal is losing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you make it... or not?</i></strong></p>",
